{"step_index":2750,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-27T13:05:25Z","input_tokens":2840,"cache_read_tokens":231939,"output_tokens":4125,"thinking":"Investigating the stylesheet for Phase 8. The goal is to identify and understand the styling requirements for several UI elements related to storage functionality, including header rows, health tags, buttons, modal components, banners, sections, stats, and card boxes. The analysis will focus on understanding how these elements are styled and their visual presentation within the context of the design phase.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import os\n\ncss_file = r'C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\app_build\\styles.css'\nwith open(css_file, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    css_content = f.read()\n\nphase8_css = \"\"\"\n/* ==========================================================================\n   PHASE 8: LOCAL PROGRESS STORAGE, BACKUP & PREFERENCES STYLES\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n/* Header Storage Row & Quick Health Tag */\n.dsa-header-storage-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  margin-top: 10px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.storage-health-tag {\n  background: #f1f5f9;\n  color: #475569;\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.btn-header-storage {\n  background: #eff6ff;\n  border: 1px solid #93c5fd;\n  color: #1d4ed8;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 5px 12px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  transition: all 0.15s;\n}\n\n.btn-header-storage:hover {\n  background: #2563eb;\n  color: white;\n  border-color: #2563eb;\n}\n\n/* Storage Modal Layout */\n.storage-modal-card {\n  max-width: 860px;\n  width: 95%;\n  max-height: 90vh;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n}\n\n.storage-modal-body {\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  padding: 20px 24px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\n/* Local Storage Transparency Notice Banner */\n.storage-notice-banner {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eff6ff 0%, #dbeafe 100%);\n  border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;\n  border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);\n  padding: 14px 18px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.storage-notice-banner .notice-icon {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  margin-top: 1px;\n}\n\n.storage-notice-banner .notice-content {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: #1e3a8a;\n}\n\n.storage-notice-banner .notice-content strong {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\n  color: #1e40af;\n}\n\n.storage-notice-banner .notice-content p {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: #334155;\n}\n\n/* Section Headings */\n.storage-section-title {\n  font-size: 14.5px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #1e293b;\n  margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n/* Live Storage Stats Grid */\n.storage-stats-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.storage-stat-item {\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm, 6px);\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.storage-stat-item .stat-icon {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.storage-stat-item .stat-info {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 2px;\n}\n\n.storage-stat-item .stat-val {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #0f172a;\n}\n\n.storage-stat-item .stat-lbl {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #64748b;\n}\n\n/* Two Column Layout: Export & Import */\n.storage-two-col {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .storage-two-col {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n\n.storage-card-box {\n  background: white;\n  border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);\n  padding: 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.storage-card-box.export-box {\n  border-top: 3px solid #2563eb;\n}\n\n.storage-card-box.import-box {\n  border-top: 3px solid #10b981;\n}\n\n.card-box-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.card-box-title {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #1e293b;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.card-box-badge {\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 2px 6px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  background: #f1f5f9;\n  color: #475569;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.card-box-desc {\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  color: #64748b;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.card-box-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n  margin-top: auto;\n}\n\n.export-feedback-toast, .pref-feedback-toast {\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #16a34a;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* Import Progress Elements */\n.import-options-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 8px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.import-mode-select {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.hidden-file-input {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.btn-file-select {\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border: 1px dashed #94a3b8;\n  color: #334155;\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-block;\n  transition: all 0.15s;\n}\n\n.btn-file-select:hover {\n  background: #eff6ff;\n  border-color: #3b82f6;\n  color: #2563eb;\n}\n\n.import-progress-textarea {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 90px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  resize: vertical;\n  color: #1e293b;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\n.import-progress-textarea:focus {\n  outline: none;\n  border-color: #3b82f6;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);\n}\n\n/* Real-time Pre-Import Validation Box */\n.storage-validation-box {\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.storage-validation-box.validation-ok {\n  background: #f0fdf4;\n  border: 1px solid #86efac;\n  color: #166534;\n}\n\n.storage-validation-box.validation-err {\n  background: #fef2f2;\n  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n  color: #991b1b;\n}\n\n.validation-title {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.validation-summary {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 6px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n}\n\n.validation-errors {\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.validation-warns {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #854d0e;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n.validation-guard-msg {\n  font-size: 10.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #b91c1c;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n/* Learning Preferences Section */\n.preferences-section {\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.preferences-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.pref-item {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.pref-label {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #475569;\n}\n\n.pref-select {\n  background: white;\n  border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 6px 10px;\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  color: #1e293b;\n}\n\n.pref-actions-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.btn-save-pref {\n  background: #1e293b;\n  color: white;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 7px 14px;\n  font-size: 12.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s;\n}\n\n.btn-save-pref:hover {\n  background: #0f172a;\n}\n\n/* Danger Zone Section */\n.danger-zone-section {\n  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n  background: #fff5f5;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md, 8px);\n  padding: 14px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 16px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.danger-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.danger-icon {\n  font-size: 22px;\n}\n\n.danger-title {\n  font-size: 13.5px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #991b1b;\n  margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n}\n\n.danger-desc {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #7f1d1d;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.btn-danger-reset {\n  background: white;\n  border: 1px solid #dc2626;\n  color: #dc2626;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 7px 14px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.15s;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.btn-danger-reset:hover {\n  background: #dc2626;\n  color: white;\n}\n\"\"\"\n\nwith open(css_file + '.tmp', 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    f.write(css_content + phase8_css)\n\nos.replace(css_file + '.tmp', css_file)\nprint(\"[SUCCESS] Appended Phase 8 styles to styles.css\")\n","Description":"Script to append Phase 8 CSS styles","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef/scratch/append_phase8_css.py","toolAction":"Creating script to append Phase 8 CSS","toolSummary":"Create script to append Phase 8 CSS"}}]}
